{"channelId":"UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","row":["ProActiveSF",6780,"Our goal is unique. It’s to keep you doing what you love by teaching you  Most healthcare practitioners think success is measured by how many times they can see you, but we know that if we keep you doing the things you love, you’ll tell your friends we’ve helped and share our videos. \n\nWe don’t need to see you 3 times per week for the rest of your life. There are too many people who really need care whom we want to help. It takes a little more time to teach you how to be involved in your care, but the payoff is exponential, subscribe today! \n\nAt ProActive Chiropractic, we fix pain and give you individualized home care instructions. Then we teach you how to prevent that terrible issue from showing back up. Find us at our Bay Area location: 22 Battery St, #600, San Francisco, CA 94111 and www.ProActiveSF.com","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:46.646Z","channelId":"UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"da8dce97d7e2f583ffe72206d3b0e831b30cbea0e60ed39d288cd7c59c720b8f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"27e13631d78803ed315a30175618f574ae4da192f5559592381b2be60a1b1cbb"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:46.646Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":6780,"raw":"6.78K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk0otc3voxpr3AhLZtM2ZmA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:46.646Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["chiropractors"],"relevantKeywords":["chiropractors"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":true,"